HB0129 School finance-dates for fund transfers.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Larson, JT, Brady, Brown, L and
Lawley and Senator(s) Jones, Olsen, Pearson, Rothfuss
and Schuler
AN ACT relating to school finance; removing an additional annual distribution
of the county school fund; and providing for an effective date.
